{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13469","headline":"蝉鸣一篇五章 三 · 宋华","name":"蝉鸣一篇五章 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉鸣蝉鸣，幽畅乎而。\n肃肃尔庭，远近凉颸。\n言赴高柳，丛篁间之。\n思而不见，如渴如饥。\n亦既觏止，我心则夷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}